#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:1 of
msgid "``self.model`` （ModelConfig）解析结果的只读视图。"
msgstr "Read-only view of the resolution result of ``self.model`` (ModelConfig)."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:5 of
msgid ""
"``AgentSnapshot.model`` 的值类型：Agent 当前模型结构体的投影。Agent 持有但不解释 ModelConfig "
"字段（只机械传给 ``provider.generate(context, model)``），快照同样只做投影不做解释。"
msgstr ""
"The value type of ``AgentSnapshot.model``: a projection of the Agent's current model structure. The Agent holds but does not interpret ModelConfig "
"fields (it only mechanically passes them to ``provider.generate(context, model)``); the snapshot likewise only projects without interpreting."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:11 of
msgid ""
"取值时机：快照生成时对 ``self.model`` 现场求值投影（Parsable 字段按 ``ModelConfig.resolve()`` "
"语义字段级求值）；本地不缓存——每次快照 反映当下值，动态改 ``self.model`` / ``model_tag`` 后下一张快照即见 "
"新值。"
msgstr ""
"When values are taken: at snapshot generation, ``self.model`` is evaluated and projected on the spot (Parsable fields are evaluated field by field per ``ModelConfig.resolve()`` "
"semantics); nothing is cached locally — each snapshot reflects the current value, so after dynamically changing ``self.model`` / ``model_tag`` the next snapshot already shows "
"the new value."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:15 of
msgid "任何字段求值失败（如 Parsable 引用缺失）：该字段以 ``None`` 投影， 快照整体不因此抛异常（观测通道不打穿核心）。"
msgstr "If any field fails to evaluate (e.g. a missing Parsable reference): that field is projected as ``None``, and the snapshot as a whole does not raise because of it (the observation channel must not pierce the core)."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:17 of
msgid ""
"``model_tag`` 为当前标签；经“直接赋 ``ModelConfig``”路径换模型时 （可指向配置中从未定义的模型）为 "
"``None``。"
msgstr ""
"``model_tag`` is the current tag; when the model is switched via the 'directly assign ``ModelConfig``' path "
"(which may point to a model never defined in the configuration), it is ``None``."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:19 of
msgid "不含 Provider 凭证、不含 ``api_key`` 等任何敏感配置（凭证不进消息、 不落盘、不进快照）。"
msgstr "Contains no Provider credentials and no sensitive configuration such as ``api_key`` (credentials never enter messages, are never persisted, and never enter snapshots)."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:21 of
msgid ""
"Agent 尚未完成模型解析（创建管线中）时，``AgentSnapshot.model`` 整体为 ``None``，而非半初始化的 "
"ModelInfo。"
msgstr ""
"When the Agent has not finished model resolution (still in the creation pipeline), ``AgentSnapshot.model`` as a whole is ``None``, rather than a half-initialized "
"ModelInfo."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo:26 of
msgid ""
"``flowing.model.ModelConfig`` / ``flowing.model.ModelConfig.resolve`` "
"``flowing.providers.Provider`` （1:1 绑定，懒创建——实例化与否不进快照） "
"``flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.model``"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.model.ModelConfig`` / ``flowing.model.ModelConfig.resolve`` "
"``flowing.providers.Provider`` (1:1 binding, lazily created — whether it is instantiated does not enter the snapshot) "
"``flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.model``"

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo.model:1 of
msgid "模型 ID（传给 API 的值）；求值失败时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Model ID (the value passed to the API); ``None`` when evaluation fails."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo.provider:1 of
msgid "绑定的 provider 条目名（1:1 单值，无候选列表、无 fallback 链）。"
msgstr "Name of the bound provider entry (a 1:1 single value; no candidate list, no fallback chain)."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo.model_tag:1 of
msgid "当前模型标签；经直接赋 ``ModelConfig`` 路径时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Current model tag; ``None`` when set via the direct-``ModelConfig``-assignment path."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo.context_window:1 of
msgid "上下文窗口大小（tokens）；模型条目未声明或求值失败时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Context window size (tokens); ``None`` when the model entry does not declare it or evaluation fails."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo.max_output_tokens:1 of
msgid "最大输出 tokens；未声明或求值失败时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Maximum output tokens; ``None`` when not declared or evaluation fails."

#: flowing.snapshot.ModelInfo.thinking_budget:1 of
msgid "思考强度；未声明或求值失败时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Thinking budget; ``None`` when not declared or evaluation fails."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:1 of
msgid "当前逻辑 turn（TurnContext）的只读视图。"
msgstr "Read-only view of the current logical turn (TurnContext)."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:5 of
msgid ""
"``AgentSnapshot.current_turn`` 的值类型：逻辑 turn 执行期临时对象 ``TurnContext`` "
"的投影。Turn 只是逻辑执行阶段（消费一条消息 → ``finish=True``），不是树节点；TurnContext "
"不落盘、不进树、崩溃后不 恢复，因此其快照视图同样只存在于执行期间。"
msgstr ""
"The value type of ``AgentSnapshot.current_turn``: a projection of the transient execution-time object ``TurnContext`` "
"of a logical turn. A turn is only a logical execution phase (consume one message → ``finish=True``), not a tree node; TurnContext "
"is not persisted, does not enter the tree, and is not recovered after a crash, so its snapshot view likewise only exists during execution."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:12 of
msgid ""
"仅当逻辑 turn 执行期间（从 turn 开始到收尾清理为止） ``AgentSnapshot.current_turn`` 非 "
"``None``；收尾观察钩子 （``after_turn``）与交付期快照即无此项——“快照无此字段”不等于 “回合钩子已跑完”。"
msgstr ""
"``AgentSnapshot.current_turn`` is non-``None`` only while a logical turn is executing (from turn start until final cleanup); "
"the finishing observation hook (``after_turn``) and delivery-time snapshots no longer have it — 'no such field in the snapshot' does not mean 'the turn hooks have all run'."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:16 of
msgid ""
"``message_count`` 含 turn 首条（触发消息）在内；逻辑标识可用 turn 首条消息 "
"id（树中真实节点），快照不提供独立的逻辑 turn 标识符。"
msgstr ""
"``message_count`` includes the turn's first message (the triggering message); the first message "
"id of the turn (a real node in the tree) can serve as its logical identity — the snapshot does not provide a separate logical turn identifier."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:18 of
msgid ""
"``aborted`` 反映 TurnContext 的取消标记（协作式 cancel 已请求）；它 是状态投影，不是取消入口——取消请走 "
"``cancel()`` / ``stop()`` 族。"
msgstr ""
"``aborted`` reflects the cancellation flag of the TurnContext (cooperative cancel has been requested); it is a state projection, not a cancellation entry point — to cancel, use the "
"``cancel()`` / ``stop()`` family."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:20 of
msgid ""
"不暴露 ``message_ids`` 列表本体（可变内部对象）；不暴露 turn 内循环 的中间 LLM 输出（流式观察走 "
"``on_provider_delta`` 钩子订阅，不走 快照轮询）。"
msgstr ""
"Does not expose the ``message_ids`` list itself (a mutable internal object); does not expose intermediate LLM outputs of the intra-turn loop (streaming observation goes through the "
"``on_provider_delta`` hook subscription, not snapshot polling)."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:23 of
msgid ""
"崩溃恢复后不出现半截 TurnContextInfo：进行中的逻辑 turn 不持久化、 不恢复，恢复后的 Agent 快照 "
"``current_turn`` 恒为 ``None`` 直到新 turn 开始。"
msgstr ""
"No half-finished TurnContextInfo appears after crash recovery: an in-progress logical turn is not persisted and not recovered; after recovery, the Agent snapshot's "
"``current_turn`` stays ``None`` until a new turn starts."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo:29 of
msgid ""
"``flowing.agent.TurnContext`` （被投影对象） ``flowing.agent.TurnResult`` （逻辑 "
"turn 的收尾产物，``turn`` 字段即 TurnContext） ``flowing.agent.Agent.cancel`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.stop``"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.agent.TurnContext`` (the projected object) ``flowing.agent.TurnResult`` (the finishing product of a logical "
"turn; its ``turn`` field is the TurnContext) ``flowing.agent.Agent.cancel`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.stop``"

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo.started_at:1 of
msgid "逻辑 turn 开始时间戳；供“本 turn 已跑多久”类计算。"
msgstr "Timestamp when the logical turn started; for 'how long has this turn been running' style calculations."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo.finished_at:1 of
msgid ""
"turn 收尾完成时间戳投影；快照仅存在于执行期间，故此字段恒为 ``None``——完整取值见 "
"``flowing.agent.TurnResult.turn.finished_at``。"
msgstr ""
"Projection of the turn finishing timestamp; since the snapshot only exists during execution, this field is always ``None`` — for the complete value see "
"``flowing.agent.TurnResult.turn.finished_at``."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo.message_count:1 of
msgid "本 turn 已产生消息的数量（含首条触发消息）；只给计数，不给 id 列表 本体。"
msgstr "Number of messages produced in this turn (including the first triggering message); only the count is given, not the id list itself."

#: flowing.snapshot.TurnContextInfo.aborted:1 of
msgid "取消标记投影：``True`` 表示协作式 cancel 已请求；只读，不是取消入口。"
msgstr "Projection of the cancellation flag: ``True`` means cooperative cancel has been requested; read-only, not a cancellation entry point."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:1 of
msgid "消息级树的规模与游标只读视图。"
msgstr "Read-only view of the message-level tree's size and cursor."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:5 of
msgid ""
"``AgentSnapshot.messages`` 的值类型：消息级树的两个标量投影——消息总数 与树游标。树节点 = "
"消息（``Message.id`` + ``Message.parent_id`` 链）， 游标 ``current_head_id`` 指向消息"
" id。"
msgstr ""
"The value type of ``AgentSnapshot.messages``: two scalar projections of the message-level tree — the total message count and the tree cursor. A tree node = "
"a message (``Message.id`` + ``Message.parent_id`` chain); the cursor ``current_head_id`` points to a message"
" id."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:11 of
msgid ""
"``count`` 为树中消息节点总数（含各分支；不含已删除的消息——删除 以 "
"tombstone（删除标记）记录，被标记的消息不计入；副线消息不落盘 不进树，不计入）。"
msgstr ""
"``count`` is the total number of message nodes in the tree (across all branches; deleted messages are not counted — deletion is recorded via a "
"tombstone (deletion marker) and marked messages are excluded; side-line messages are neither persisted nor enter the tree, so they are not counted either)."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:14 of
msgid "``head_id`` 即 ``current_head_id`` 的值（消息 id）；空树（尚无已挂树 消息）时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "``head_id`` is the value of ``current_head_id`` (a message id); ``None`` for an empty tree (no message attached to the tree yet)."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:16 of
msgid "fork 只切游标不动树：fork 后 ``head_id`` 变化、``count`` 不变。"
msgstr "fork only moves the cursor without touching the tree: after a fork, ``head_id`` changes while ``count`` does not."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:17 of
msgid ""
"崩溃恢复后：``head_id`` 指向最后一条已挂树消息；半截逻辑 turn 的消息 保留在树中（计入 "
"``count``），组装上下文时才会截断到最后一个 ``turn_end=True`` 边界——快照如实投影树内容，不做上下文截断。"
msgstr ""
"After crash recovery: ``head_id`` points to the last message attached to the tree; messages of a half-finished logical turn remain in the tree (counted in "
"``count``) and are only truncated to the last ``turn_end=True`` boundary when the context is assembled — the snapshot projects the tree content faithfully and performs no context truncation."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:20 of
msgid "不提供分支枚举、不提供消息内容、不提供按 id 反查（反查走正式读取 路径 ``MessageChain`` / 持久化层）。"
msgstr "Provides no branch enumeration, no message content, and no lookup by id (lookup goes through the formal read path ``MessageChain`` / the persistence layer)."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo:25 of
msgid ""
"``flowing.message.Message`` / ``flowing.message.MessageChain`` "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.current_head_id`` "
"``flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.current_head_id``"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.message.Message`` / ``flowing.message.MessageChain`` "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.current_head_id`` "
"``flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.current_head_id``"

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo.count:1 of
msgid "树中消息节点总数（含各分支；不含已删除（tombstone 标记）的消息与 副线消息）。"
msgstr "Total number of message nodes in the tree (across all branches; excluding deleted (tombstone-marked) messages and side-line messages)."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageTreeInfo.head_id:1 of
msgid "树游标（``current_head_id`` 的值，消息 id）；空树为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Tree cursor (the value of ``current_head_id``, a message id); ``None`` for an empty tree."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo:1 of
msgid "消息队列规模的只读视图。"
msgstr "Read-only view of the message queue size."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo:5 of
msgid ""
"``AgentSnapshot.message_queue`` 的值类型：每 Agent 独立消息队列的两个 计数投影——待消费消息数与等待 "
"``message()`` 结果的 pending 数。队列 内部是 deque 与等待中的 Future，均为可变内部对象；观测只需要两个计数 "
"即可回答“有没有积压”“有没有人等结果”。"
msgstr ""
"The value type of ``AgentSnapshot.message_queue``: two count projections of each Agent's independent message queue — the number of messages awaiting consumption and the number of pending waiters for "
"``message()`` results. Inside the queue are a deque and waiting Futures, all mutable internal objects; observation only needs two counts "
"to answer 'is there a backlog' and 'is anyone waiting for a result'."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo:12 of
msgid "``size``：已入队未出队的消息数；cancel 后待处理消息不丢弃，因此 cancel 后 ``size`` 不归零（处置交应用层）。"
msgstr "``size``: number of messages enqueued but not yet dequeued; cancel does not discard pending messages, so ``size`` does not return to zero after cancel (disposal is left to the application layer)."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo:14 of
msgid ""
"``pending``：等待 ``message()`` 结果、尚未 resolve 的等待者数；逻辑 turn 收尾 resolve "
"waiters 后递减。"
msgstr ""
"``pending``: number of waiters awaiting a ``message()`` result that have not been resolved yet; decremented after the logical turn's finalization resolves the "
"waiters."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo:16 of
msgid ""
"``destroy()`` 后不应再调用 ``snapshot()``——对池条目状态的观察请用 "
"``RuntimeSnapshot.agents[id].loaded``。"
msgstr ""
"``snapshot()`` should not be called after ``destroy()`` — to observe pool entry state, use "
"``RuntimeSnapshot.agents[id].loaded``."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo:18 of
msgid "不提供队列内容枚举（内容走钩子订阅 ``after_enqueue`` / ``before_dequeue`` 或消息级树读取）。"
msgstr "Provides no enumeration of queue contents (content goes through the hook subscriptions ``after_enqueue`` / ``before_dequeue`` or message-level tree reads)."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo:23 of
msgid ""
"``flowing.message.MessageQueue`` ``flowing.agent.Agent.message`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.enqueue_message`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.cancel_queued``"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.message.MessageQueue`` ``flowing.agent.Agent.message`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.enqueue_message`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.cancel_queued``"

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo.size:1 of
msgid "待消费消息数（已入队未出队）；cancel 不丢弃待处理消息，故不归零。"
msgstr "Number of messages awaiting consumption (enqueued, not yet dequeued); cancel does not discard pending messages, so it does not return to zero."

#: flowing.snapshot.MessageQueueInfo.pending:1 of
msgid "等待 ``message()`` 结果的 pending 数（未 resolve 的 waiter 计数）。"
msgstr "Number of pending waiters for ``message()`` results (count of unresolved waiters)."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:1 of
msgid "Runtime 的一致性只读快照：``runtime.snapshot()`` 的返回类型。"
msgstr "Consistent read-only snapshot of the Runtime: the return type of ``runtime.snapshot()``."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:5 of
msgid ""
"Runtime 全局存储的单时刻一致切片：对象图（``nodes``）、插件清单 （``plugins``）、agent "
"池注册表（``agents``）、provider 候选清单名 "
"（``providers``）、配置覆盖层只读副本（``config_overrides``）、Resource "
"注册名（``resources``）。快照对应 Runtime 各全局存储的读投影，一处存储 "
"一个字段，不多不少；核心不为插件状态留挂载点——插件状态经插件自己的 只读 API "
"观测（``runtime.get_plugin(...)``）。"
msgstr ""
"A single-moment consistent slice of the Runtime's global stores: the object graph (``nodes``), the plugin list (``plugins``), the agent "
"pool registry (``agents``), provider candidate list names "
"(``providers``), a read-only copy of the config override layer (``config_overrides``), and Resource "
"registration names (``resources``). The snapshot corresponds to read projections of the Runtime's global stores, one field per store, "
"no more and no less; the core leaves no mount point for plugin state — plugin state is observed via each plugin's own read-only API "
"(``runtime.get_plugin(...)``)."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:25 of
msgid ""
"一致性：一次调用内全部字段同一时刻取值（见模块 docstring“单时刻 一致性”）；返回结构与内部存储隔离（副本 / 不可变视图），修改快照 "
"不影响框架状态。"
msgstr ""
"Consistency: all fields are taken at the same moment within one call (see the module docstring section 'single-moment consistency'); the returned structure is isolated from internal storage (copies / immutable views), so mutating the snapshot "
"does not affect framework state."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:28 of
msgid "无副作用、不抛异常：正常路径（含 shutdown 进行中）返回当前可得 切片。"
msgstr "No side effects, no exceptions: the normal path (including while shutdown is in progress) returns the currently available slice."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:30 of
msgid ""
"不暴露项：节点 / Agent / Provider 实例本体；``_provided`` dict；配置 命名空间原文中的敏感值（API key"
" 等凭证不进快照）；任何 ``asyncio.Event`` / Task / Future。"
msgstr ""
"Not exposed: the node / Agent / Provider instances themselves; the ``_provided`` dict; sensitive values in the raw config namespaces (credentials such as API keys"
" never enter snapshots); any ``asyncio.Event`` / Task / Future."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:33 of
msgid "provider 清单只给候选名——实例化与否（懒创建）不进快照；未加载任何 模型条目时 ``providers`` 为空列表而非报错。"
msgstr "The provider list only gives candidate names — whether they are instantiated (lazy creation) does not enter the snapshot; when no model entry is loaded, ``providers`` is an empty list rather than an error."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:35 of
msgid "前置条件：无（``launch`` 返回后即可调用）；后置条件：无（纯观察）。"
msgstr "Preconditions: none (callable right after ``launch`` returns); postconditions: none (pure observation)."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot:39 of
msgid ""
"``flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`` ``flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot`` "
"``flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_agent`` / "
"``flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown``"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`` ``flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot`` "
"``flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_agent`` / "
"``flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown``"

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot.nodes:1 of
msgid ""
"``node_id`` → ``NodeInfo``；共享 ID 空间（``runtime-*`` / ``workflow-*`` / "
"``agent-*``）中全部节点的只读投影。注：Runtime 无 生命周期状态机，无 ``status`` 字段——“Runtime "
"是否已关闭”见 ``Runtime.shutdown()`` 语义（``shutdown()`` 返回后即可知）。"
msgstr ""
"``node_id`` → ``NodeInfo``; read-only projection of all nodes in the shared ID space (``runtime-*`` / ``workflow-*`` / "
"``agent-*``). Note: the Runtime has no lifecycle state machine and no ``status`` field — for 'whether the Runtime "
"has been shut down' see the semantics of ``Runtime.shutdown()`` (known as soon as ``shutdown()`` returns)."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot.plugins:1 of
msgid ""
"已安装插件名（``plugin.name``）列表；未 ``runtime.install(...)`` 的扩展 不出现（“没存在过”，不是“被 "
"skip”）。"
msgstr ""
"List of installed plugin names (``plugin.name``); extensions never passed to ``runtime.install(...)`` do not appear ('never existed', not 'was "
"skipped')."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot.agents:1 of
msgid ""
"``agent_id`` → ``AgentInfo``；agent 池注册表投影（含未实例化条目， 见 "
"``AgentInfo.loaded``）。只给池级“有没有、载没载”，不展开 Agent 内部状态——实例级观测走 "
"``agent.snapshot()`` （两级快照不嵌套）。"
msgstr ""
"``agent_id`` → ``AgentInfo``; projection of the agent pool registry (including uninstantiated entries, see "
"``AgentInfo.loaded``). Only gives pool-level 'exists or not, loaded or not', without expanding Agent internals — instance-level observation goes through "
"``agent.snapshot()`` (the two snapshot levels are not nested)."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot.providers:1 of
msgid "provider 候选清单名（仅名字；懒创建，实例化与否不进快照）。"
msgstr "Provider candidate list names (names only; lazily created, and whether they are instantiated does not enter the snapshot)."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot.config_overrides:1 of
msgid "配置覆盖层（``set_config`` 写入）的只读副本；修改它不回写框架。副本 中不含凭证类敏感值。"
msgstr "Read-only copy of the config override layer (written by ``set_config``); modifying it does not write back to the framework. The copy contains no credential-type sensitive values."

#: flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot.resources:1 of
msgid "Resource 注册名列表（仅名字）。"
msgstr "List of Resource registration names (names only)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:1 of
msgid "单个 Agent 的一致性只读快照：``agent.snapshot()`` 的返回类型。"
msgstr "Consistent read-only snapshot of a single Agent: the return type of ``agent.snapshot()``."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:5 of
msgid ""
"Agent 实例状态的单时刻一致切片：标识与关系（``node_id`` / ``parent_id`` / "
"``agent_type``）、消息级树视图（``messages`` / ``current_head_id``）、当前逻辑 "
"turn（``current_turn``）、活跃执行 "
"（``executions``）、消息队列规模（``message_queue``）、模型解析结果 "
"（``model``）、能力绑定（``tool_entries`` / ``subagent_entries``）、 "
"上下文占用估计（``context_usage``）。"
msgstr ""
"A single-moment consistent slice of an Agent instance's state: identity and relations (``node_id`` / ``parent_id`` / "
"``agent_type``), the message-level tree view (``messages`` / ``current_head_id``), the current logical "
"turn (``current_turn``), active executions "
"(``executions``), message queue size (``message_queue``), the model resolution result "
"(``model``), capability bindings (``tool_entries`` / ``subagent_entries``), and the "
"context usage estimate (``context_usage``)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:12 of
msgid ""
"与 ``RuntimeSnapshot`` 分工：池级“有没有、载没载”看 Runtime 快照； 实例级“在跑什么”看 Agent "
"快照（实例未加载时应先看 ``RuntimeSnapshot.agents[id].loaded``）。"
msgstr ""
"Division of labor with ``RuntimeSnapshot``: for pool-level 'exists or not, loaded or not' look at the Runtime snapshot; for instance-level 'what is running' look at the Agent "
"snapshot (when the instance is not loaded, check ``RuntimeSnapshot.agents[id].loaded`` first)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:29 of
msgid "一致性 / 隔离 / 无副作用：同 ``RuntimeSnapshot`` （见模块 docstring 一致性四条）。"
msgstr "Consistency / isolation / no side effects: same as ``RuntimeSnapshot`` (see the four consistency points in the module docstring)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:31 of
msgid ""
"不暴露项：``cancel`` / ``pause`` 控制信号 Event；``TurnContext`` 的 ``message_ids`` "
"/ ``pending_messages`` 列表本体；队列内部 deque； ``_pending_turns`` 的 "
"Future；``_provided`` / ``_children`` / ``_messages`` 等内部 dict 引用；模型凭证。"
msgstr ""
"Not exposed: the ``cancel`` / ``pause`` control-signal Events; the ``message_ids`` "
"/ ``pending_messages`` lists of ``TurnContext`` themselves; the queue's internal deque; the Futures of "
"``_pending_turns``; internal dict references such as ``_provided`` / ``_children`` / ``_messages``; model credentials."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:35 of
msgid ""
"实例已 ``destroy()`` 后不应再调用（池级观察走 ``RuntimeSnapshot.agents``）；恢复后的 Agent "
"首张快照 ``current_turn is None`` （进行中的逻辑 turn 不恢复）。"
msgstr ""
"Should not be called after the instance has been ``destroy()`` (pool-level observation goes through ``RuntimeSnapshot.agents``); the first snapshot of a recovered Agent has "
"``current_turn is None`` (an in-progress logical turn is not recovered)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:38 of
msgid "不提供消息内容、不提供 LLM 可见 schema、不提供历史轨迹（历史 = 日志 插件策略，经钩子订阅收集）。"
msgstr "Provides no message content, no LLM-visible schema, and no history trail (history = a logging plugin policy, collected via hook subscriptions)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot:43 of
msgid ""
"``flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.current_head_id`` / "
"``flowing.message.MessageChain`` ``flowing.agent.TurnContext`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Execution`` ``flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot``"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.agent.Agent.snapshot`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Agent.current_head_id`` / "
"``flowing.message.MessageChain`` ``flowing.agent.TurnContext`` / "
"``flowing.agent.Execution`` ``flowing.snapshot.RuntimeSnapshot``"

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.node_id:1 of
msgid "节点 id（``== agent_id == session_id``，身份连续、可重现）。"
msgstr "Node id (``== agent_id == session_id``; the identity is continuous and reproducible)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.parent_id:1 of
msgid ""
"亲节点 id。``None`` 当且仅当该节点是 Runtime 自身（链终点无亲节点）；根 Agent 的亲节点指针指向其 Runtime 的 "
"``node_id``——“根”由“亲节点是 Runtime” 表达，不由 ``None`` 表达。"
msgstr ""
"Parent node id. ``None`` if and only if the node is the Runtime itself (the chain endpoint has no parent); a root Agent's parent pointer points to its Runtime's "
"``node_id`` — 'root' is expressed by 'the parent is the Runtime', not by ``None``."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.agent_type:1 of
msgid "字符串类型名（与池注册表元数据一致）。"
msgstr "String type name (consistent with the pool registry metadata)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.paused:1 of
msgid ""
"是否暂停中（``Agent.paused`` 的投影）。注：Agent 无生命周期状态机 ——“在干什么”由 ``current_turn`` /"
" ``executions`` / ``paused`` 等 投影字段直接表达，快照不汇总出单一状态值。"
msgstr ""
"Whether it is paused (a projection of ``Agent.paused``). Note: the Agent has no lifecycle state machine — 'what it is doing' is expressed directly by projection fields such as ``current_turn`` /"
" ``executions`` / ``paused``; the snapshot does not aggregate a single status value."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.messages:1 of
msgid "消息级树规模与游标视图。"
msgstr "View of the message-level tree's size and cursor."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.current_head_id:1 of
msgid ""
"树游标值（消息 id），与 ``messages.head_id`` 同源同刻；空树为 ``None``。单独成字段是为与既有 "
"``Agent.current_head_id`` 属性读法对齐。"
msgstr ""
"The tree cursor value (a message id), same source and same moment as ``messages.head_id``; ``None`` for an empty tree. It is a standalone field to align with the existing "
"``Agent.current_head_id`` attribute accessor."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.current_turn:1 of
msgid "当前逻辑 turn 只读视图；无执行中 turn 时为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Read-only view of the current logical turn; ``None`` when no turn is executing."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.executions:1 of
msgid ""
"执行条目 id → ``ExecutionInfo``；不含控制信号（``cancel`` / ``pause`` Event "
"永不进快照）。只含存活期条目（清理有 ``finally`` 保证）。"
msgstr ""
"Execution entry id → ``ExecutionInfo``; contains no control signals (the ``cancel`` / ``pause`` Events "
"never enter the snapshot). Only contains live entries (cleanup is guaranteed by ``finally``)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.message_queue:1 of
msgid "消息队列规模视图。"
msgstr "View of the message queue size."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.model:1 of
msgid "``self.model`` 解析结果只读视图；模型尚未解析（创建管线中）为 ``None``。"
msgstr "Read-only view of the ``self.model`` resolution result; ``None`` while the model has not been resolved yet (in the creation pipeline)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.tool_entries:1 of
msgid "工具绑定条目列表（本 Agent 上的绑定结果，按别名投影）。"
msgstr "List of tool binding entries (the binding results on this Agent, projected by alias)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.subagent_entries:1 of
msgid "子 Agent 绑定条目列表（``agent_type`` 字段有值）。"
msgstr "List of sub-Agent binding entries (with the ``agent_type`` field populated)."

#: flowing.snapshot.AgentSnapshot.context_usage:1 of
msgid ""
"上下文占用估计的观测投影（快照时刻 ``Agent.estimate_context_tokens()`` 的取值；锚点实测 + "
"尾部估算的混合值，``usage_ratio`` 不 clamp、``>1`` 即溢出信号）。纯观测、永不用于计费；模型尚未解析（创建管线中）为 "
"``None``。"
msgstr ""
"Observation projection of the context usage estimate (the value of ``Agent.estimate_context_tokens()`` at snapshot time; a hybrid of anchor measurement + "
"tail estimation; ``usage_ratio`` is not clamped and ``>1`` signals overflow). Pure observation, never used for billing; ``None`` while the model has not been resolved yet (in the creation pipeline): "
"``None``."

#: ../../api/flowing.rst:153
msgid "flowing.subagents module"
msgstr "flowing.subagents module"

#: flowing.subagents:1 of
msgid "``flowing.subagents`` —— 子智能体子系统的绑定与结果类型。"
msgstr "``flowing.subagents`` — binding and result types of the subagent subsystem."

#: flowing.subagents:5 of
msgid "本模块承载子智能体（子 Agent）子系统的绑定与结果类型："
msgstr "This module hosts the binding and result types of the subagent (sub-Agent) subsystem:"

#: flowing.subagents:7 of
msgid ""
":class:`SubagentEntry` —— Agent 对子 Agent 类型的一次“用法声明”， 能力三正交（可执行对象 / LLM "
"可见声明 / Agent 级绑定三个维度）的 Agent 级绑定层（与 :class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry` "
"同构）：LLM 看到 的别名与描述、参数覆写 / 指定值 / 注入。"
msgstr ""
":class:`SubagentEntry` — one 'usage declaration' of a sub-Agent type on an Agent; the Agent-level binding layer of the capability tri-orthogonality (executable object / LLM-"
"visible declaration / Agent-level binding, three dimensions), isomorphic to :class:`flowing.tool.ToolEntry`: the alias and description the LLM sees, "
"parameter overrides / specified values / injection."

#: flowing.subagents:11 of
msgid ""
":class:`SubagentInvocation` —— ``before_subagent_invoke`` / "
"``after_subagent_invoke`` 钩子的 value。"
msgstr ""
":class:`SubagentInvocation` — the value of the ``before_subagent_invoke`` / "
"``after_subagent_invoke`` hooks."

#: flowing.subagents:13 of
msgid ":class:`SubagentResult` —— 子 Agent 一次唤起的返回结果。"
msgstr ":class:`SubagentResult` — the result returned by one invocation of a sub-Agent."

#: flowing.subagents:14 of
msgid ""
":data:`DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` —— ``<available_subagents>`` "
"渲染槽位的内置缺省模板。"
msgstr ""
":data:`DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` — the builtin default template for the ``<available_subagents>`` "
"rendering slot."

#: flowing.subagents:17 of
msgid ""
"唤起管线本体（``Agent.invoke_subagent`` / ``Agent.add_agent``）与 catalog 渲染留在 "
":mod:`flowing.agent`——本模块只定义管线操作的条目与 产物类型。"
msgstr ""
"The invocation pipeline itself (``Agent.invoke_subagent`` / ``Agent.add_agent``) and catalog rendering stay in "
":mod:`flowing.agent` — this module only defines the entry and product types of pipeline operations."

#: flowing.subagents:23 of
msgid ""
"子 Agent 唤起是两段式时序（见 :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.invoke_subagent`）： "
"准备段按别名查条目 → :meth:`SubagentEntry.resolve` 聚合参数 → 构造 "
":class:`SubagentInvocation` 并 dispatch 亲代 Agent 的 "
"``before_subagent_invoke`` → 新建 / 续接子 Agent（此段失败同步上抛）； 运行段等待子 Agent 产出 → "
"构造 :class:`SubagentResult` → dispatch ``after_subagent_invoke`` "
"（先于交付，handler 可改写 result）→ 交付。 两个钩子都挂在亲代 Agent 的 hooks 上。"
msgstr ""
"Sub-Agent invocation is a two-phase sequence (see :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.invoke_subagent`): "
"the preparation phase looks up the entry by alias → :meth:`SubagentEntry.resolve` aggregates parameters → constructs "
"a :class:`SubagentInvocation` and dispatches the parent Agent's "
"``before_subagent_invoke`` → creates / resumes the sub-Agent (failures in this phase are raised synchronously); the run phase waits for the sub-Agent's output → "
"constructs a :class:`SubagentResult` → dispatches ``after_subagent_invoke`` "
"(before delivery; the handler may rewrite the result) → delivers. Both hooks are registered on the parent Agent's hooks."

#: flowing.subagents:30 of
msgid ""
"子 Agent 产出有两条载体：``invoke_subagent`` 同步返回 :class:`SubagentResult` "
"（不入亲代队列，调用方自行处置）；后台唤起路径 （``subagent-invoke`` 工具的 "
"``asynchronized=True``）完成时以独立 ``Message(kind=SUBAGENT)`` 推入亲代 Agent "
"队列，LLM 在后续回合感知。 两条路径内容同源：都采用 ``after_subagent_invoke`` 改写后的 result。"
msgstr ""
"A sub-Agent's output has two carriers: ``invoke_subagent`` returns a :class:`SubagentResult` synchronously "
"(not enqueued into the parent queue; the caller disposes of it); the background invocation path (the "
"``asynchronized=True`` mode of the ``subagent-invoke`` tool) pushes a standalone ``Message(kind=SUBAGENT)`` into the parent Agent's "
"queue on completion, which the LLM perceives in a later turn. The two paths share the same content source: both use the result rewritten by ``after_subagent_invoke``."

#: flowing.subagents:35 of
msgid ""
"没有子 Agent 专属错误钩子：唤起 / 运行失败以异常原样上抛调用方； ``subagent-invoke`` 工具路径由 "
"``ToolResult(status=\"error\")`` 承载。"
msgstr ""
"There is no sub-Agent-specific error hook: invocation / run failures are raised to the caller as-is as exceptions; the ``subagent-invoke`` tool path carries them via "
"``ToolResult(status=\"error\")``."

#: flowing.subagents:40 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.agent` —— 子 Agent 唤起管线与 catalog 渲染。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.agent` — the sub-Agent invocation pipeline and catalog rendering."

#: flowing.subagents:41 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.hooks` —— ``before_subagent_invoke`` / "
"``after_subagent_invoke`` 钩子点契约。"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.hooks` — the contract of the ``before_subagent_invoke`` / "
"``after_subagent_invoke`` hook points."

#: flowing.subagents:43 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.tool` —— 同构的 Tool 绑定层（``ToolEntry``）。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.tool` — the isomorphic Tool binding layer (``ToolEntry``)."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:1 of
msgid "内置默认子智能体 catalog 模板：把逐条 ``<subagent>`` 片段包进 ``<available_subagents>``。"
msgstr "Builtin default subagent catalog template: wraps the per-entry ``<subagent>`` fragments into ``<available_subagents>``."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:6 of
msgid ""
"``<available_subagents>`` 渲染槽位的内置缺省值（与 "
":data:`flowing.plugins.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` 同一约定）：槽位 只收 "
"Jinja2 模板字符串，不收 callable——定制即整体替换模板，本常量公开 供参考 / 派生。Agent 级覆写槽位为 "
":attr:`flowing.agent.Agent.subagent_catalog_template`。"
msgstr ""
"The builtin default value of the ``<available_subagents>`` rendering slot (same convention as "
":data:`flowing.plugins.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE`): the slot only accepts "
"Jinja2 template strings, not callables — customization means replacing the template wholesale; this constant is public for reference / derivation. The Agent-level override slot is "
":attr:`flowing.agent.Agent.subagent_catalog_template`."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:13 of
msgid "模板上下文变量"
msgstr "Template context variables"

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:14 of
msgid "``entries``：逐条预计算视图 dict 列表——每个元素是 :meth:`SubagentEntry.catalog_view` 的产物："
msgstr "``entries``: a list of per-entry precomputed view dicts — each element is the product of :meth:`SubagentEntry.catalog_view`:"

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:17 of
msgid "``name``：别名（``SubagentEntry.name_alias``）；"
msgstr "``name``: the alias (``SubagentEntry.name_alias``);"

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:18 of
msgid "``description``：已解析描述串（覆写求值在 Python 侧完成）；"
msgstr "``description``: the resolved description string (override evaluation is done on the Python side);"

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:19 of
msgid "``params_xml``：已应用覆写 / 改名 / 排除规则后的参数段 XML （含前导 ``<params>`` 片段或空串）。"
msgstr "``params_xml``: the parameter-section XML after override / rename / exclusion rules have been applied (the leading ``<params>`` fragment or an empty string)."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:22 of
msgid ""
"预计算在 Python 侧完成，模板只负责排布（不在模板内 ``.resolve()``——与 skills "
"模板的“模板内求值”不同，本模板的求值 已前移到 ``catalog_view``）。"
msgstr ""
"Precomputation is done on the Python side; the template only handles layout (no ``.resolve()`` inside the template — unlike the "
"skills template's 'in-template evaluation', this template's evaluation has been moved forward into ``catalog_view``)."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:25 of
msgid "``agent``：亲代 Agent 实例。"
msgstr "``agent``: the parent Agent instance."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:29 of
msgid ""
"渲染经 Parsable TEMPLATE 语义（include 基准为亲代 Agent 的 ``source_dir``）；渲染异常 fail-"
"fast 上抛，不静默降级。"
msgstr ""
"Rendering follows Parsable TEMPLATE semantics (the include base is the parent Agent's ``source_dir``); rendering exceptions fail-"
"fast and propagate, with no silent degradation."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:31 of
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"空列表经 ``{% if entries %}`` 渲染为 ``\"\"`` （整块不注入； "
"``Agent._render_subagent_catalog`` 在此之前也有短路，双保险）。"
msgstr ""
"An empty list renders as ``\"\"`` via ``{% if entries %}`` (the whole block is not injected; "
"``Agent._render_subagent_catalog`` also short-circuits before this — double protection)."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:36 of
msgid "产物形态："
msgstr "Product form:"

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:44 of
msgid "自定义（整体替换；类属性或 ``.fya`` 同名字段均可，``getattr`` 同样命中）："
msgstr "Customization (wholesale replacement; either a class attribute or a ``.fya`` field of the same name works — ``getattr`` hits both):"

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:53 of
msgid ":attr:`flowing.agent.Agent.subagent_catalog_template` —— Agent 级 覆写槽位。"
msgstr ":attr:`flowing.agent.Agent.subagent_catalog_template` — the Agent-level override slot."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:55 of
msgid ":meth:`SubagentEntry.catalog_view` —— ``entries`` 元素的生产方。"
msgstr ":meth:`SubagentEntry.catalog_view` — the producer of the ``entries`` elements."

#: flowing.subagents.DEFAULT_SUBAGENT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE:56 of
msgid ""
":data:`flowing.plugins.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` —— 同 约定的 Skill "
"侧缺省模板。"
msgstr ""
":data:`flowing.plugins.skills.DEFAULT_CATALOG_TEMPLATE` — the Skill-side default template under the same "
"convention."

#: ../../api/flowing.rst:161
msgid "flowing.tool module"
msgstr "flowing.tool module"

#: flowing.tool:1 of
msgid "``flowing.tool`` —— 工具子系统：能力三正交中的 Tool 维度。"
msgstr "``flowing.tool`` — the tool subsystem: the Tool dimension of the capability tri-orthogonality."

#: flowing.tool:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义工具子系统的全部公开类型：可执行对象（:class:`Tool` 基类、 :class:`ScriptTool` "
"作者基类，以及三种按声明驱动的具体实现 :class:`McpTool` / :class:`CliTool` / "
":class:`RequestTool`）、LLM 可见 声明（:class:`ToolDefinition`）、Agent "
"级绑定（:class:`ToolEntry`）、 调用与结果（:class:`ToolCall` / "
":class:`ToolResult`，状态四值见 "
":data:`ToolStatus`）、全局注册表（:class:`ToolRegistry`）、工具类型 "
"判别值（:data:`ToolType`）、打标装饰器（:func:`flowing_tool`），以及 "
"结果归一与媒体族（:func:`normalize_output` / :func:`output_to_blocks`、 媒体载体 "
":class:`Image` / :class:`File` / :class:`Audio` / :class:`Video`、转换器 "
":class:`MediaConverter` / :func:`register_media_converter`）。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines all public types of the tool subsystem: executable objects (the :class:`Tool` base class, the :class:`ScriptTool` "
"author base class, and the three declaration-driven concrete implementations :class:`McpTool` / :class:`CliTool` / "
":class:`RequestTool`), the LLM-visible declaration (:class:`ToolDefinition`), the Agent-"
"level binding (:class:`ToolEntry`), invocation and result (:class:`ToolCall` / "
":class:`ToolResult`, the four status values in "
":data:`ToolStatus`), the global registry (:class:`ToolRegistry`), the tool type "
"discriminator (:data:`ToolType`), the marking decorator (:func:`flowing_tool`), and "
"result normalization plus the media family (:func:`normalize_output` / :func:`output_to_blocks`, the media carriers "
":class:`Image` / :class:`File` / :class:`Audio` / :class:`Video`, and the converter "
":class:`MediaConverter` / :func:`register_media_converter`)."

#: flowing.tool:17 of
msgid ""
"框架自带的出厂内置工具（核心 ``SubagentInvokeTool`` 与标准件 ``FinishTool`` 等）定义在 "
":mod:`flowing.builtins`，不在本模块。"
msgstr ""
"The framework's factory builtin tools (the core ``SubagentInvokeTool`` and standard ones such as ``FinishTool``) are defined in "
":mod:`flowing.builtins`, not in this module."

#: flowing.tool:20 of
msgid "能力三正交（Tool / 子 Agent / Skill 共享同一模式，三个维度各自独立 演化、互不侵入）："
msgstr "Capability tri-orthogonality (Tool / sub-Agent / Skill share the same pattern; the three dimensions evolve independently and do not intrude on each other):"

#: flowing.tool:26 of
msgid "维度"
msgstr "Dimension"

#: flowing.tool:27 of
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "Tool"

#: flowing.tool:28 of
msgid "子 Agent"
msgstr "sub-Agent"

#: flowing.tool:29 of
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "Skill"

#: flowing.tool:30 of
msgid "可执行对象"
msgstr "Executable object"

#: flowing.tool:31 of
msgid ":class:`Tool` （``execute()``）"
msgstr ":class:`Tool` (``execute()``)"

#: flowing.tool:32 of
msgid "Agent 类"
msgstr "Agent class"

#: flowing.tool:33 of
msgid "Skill 内容"
msgstr "Skill content"

#: flowing.tool:34 of
msgid "LLM 可见声明"
msgstr "LLM-visible declaration"

#: flowing.tool:35 of
msgid ":class:`ToolDefinition`"
msgstr ":class:`ToolDefinition`"

#: flowing.tool:36 flowing.tool:37 of
msgid "catalog XML 条目"
msgstr "catalog XML entry"

#: flowing.tool:38 of
msgid "Agent 级绑定"
msgstr "Agent-level binding"

#: flowing.tool:39 of
msgid ":class:`ToolEntry`"
msgstr ":class:`ToolEntry`"

#: flowing.tool:40 of
msgid "``SubagentEntry``"
msgstr "``SubagentEntry``"

#: flowing.tool:41 of
msgid "``SkillEntry`` （扩展）"
msgstr "``SkillEntry`` (extension)"

#: flowing.tool:43 of
msgid ""
"绑定层独立存在的理由：同一个工具在不同 Agent 上可以呈现不同的 LLM 视图（如 ``FinishTool`` 在 "
"ReviewerAgent 上暴露 ``score`` / ``pass`` / ``issues``，在 PaymentAgent 上暴露 "
"``transaction_id`` / ``status`` / ``charged_amount``）——通过 `ToolEntry` "
"覆写实现，不改全局注册表、 不改工具本身。"
msgstr ""
"Why the binding layer exists independently: the same tool can present different LLM views on different Agents (e.g. ``FinishTool`` exposes "
"``score`` / ``pass`` / ``issues`` on ReviewerAgent and "
"``transaction_id`` / ``status`` / ``charged_amount`` on PaymentAgent) — implemented via `ToolEntry` "
"overrides, without touching the global registry or the tool itself."

#: flowing.tool:49 of
msgid "本模块全部公开签名属跨版本稳定契约；``_`` 前缀符号为内部 API，不属 稳定契约。"
msgstr "All public signatures in this module are part of the cross-version stable contract; ``_``-prefixed symbols are internal API and are not part of the stable contract."

#: flowing.tool:54 of
msgid ""
"工具调用时序：LLM 在一次逻辑 Turn 中发出工具调用后，框架按固定顺序 处理。``Agent.tool_call`` 先 dispatch "
"``before_tool_call`` 钩子 （handler 可改写 `ToolCall` 的参数；把 `ToolResult` 放进 "
"``shortcut`` 字段可跳过工具执行；``raise Intercepted`` 硬阻断，工具不执行、结果 为 "
"``blocked``），随后仅按别名查找 Agent 的工具绑定表（找不到抛 ``UnknownToolError``）、聚合参数，经 "
"``Tool.__call__`` 执行，最后 dispatch ``after_tool_call`` （可改写结果）并在返回前对结果做一次 "
"幂等归一（已归一的值重复归一结果不变）。完整时序见 :mod:`flowing.agent`，钩子语义见 "
":mod:`flowing.hooks`。"
msgstr ""
"Tool invocation sequence: after the LLM issues a tool call within a logical Turn, the framework processes it in a fixed order. ``Agent.tool_call`` first dispatches the "
"``before_tool_call`` hook (the handler may rewrite the `ToolCall`'s parameters; putting a `ToolResult` into the "
"``shortcut`` field skips tool execution; ``raise Intercepted`` hard-blocks — the tool is not executed and the result is "
"``blocked``), then looks up the Agent's tool binding table by alias only (raising ``UnknownToolError`` if not found), aggregates parameters, executes via "
"``Tool.__call__``, and finally dispatches ``after_tool_call`` (which may rewrite the result) and applies one "
"idempotent normalization to the result before returning (normalizing an already-normalized value changes nothing). The full sequence is in :mod:`flowing.agent`; hook semantics in "
":mod:`flowing.hooks`."

#: flowing.tool:63 of
msgid ""
"``builtin::`` 命名空间：出厂内置工具注册在 ``builtin::`` 命名空间下。 裸名查找先查 ``default::`` 再查"
" ``builtin::``——插件 / 应用可以在 ``default::`` 注册同名工具覆盖内置行为，被覆盖的条目仍可用 "
"``builtin::xxx`` 全限定名显式引用。注册不等于可见：Agent 的工具目录 只包含它在 ``.fya`` 或 "
"``add_tool`` 中显式声明的条目；可写文件、 执行命令等危险工具必须由使用者显式声明，框架不会因为注册就把它们 暴露给 LLM。"
msgstr ""
"``builtin::`` namespace: factory builtin tools are registered under the ``builtin::`` namespace. A bare-name lookup checks ``default::`` first, then "
"``builtin::`` — a plugin / application can register a same-named tool in ``default::`` to override builtin behavior, and the overridden entry can still be explicitly referenced by its "
"``builtin::xxx`` fully qualified name. Registered does not mean visible: an Agent's tool catalog only contains the entries it explicitly declares in ``.fya`` or "
"``add_tool``; dangerous tools such as file-writing or command-execution ones must be explicitly declared by the user — the framework never exposes them to the LLM merely because they are registered."

#: flowing.tool:71 of
msgid ""
"参数优先级：指定值（``specified``，含注入表达式）最高，其次 LLM 传入参数，最后 schema 默认值。指定值对 LLM "
"不可见、不可被 LLM 覆盖 ——固定值或宿主上下文注入的参数（``user_id`` / ``trace_id`` 等）用 "
"指定值声明，这是防篡改的安全边界。注入表达式 ``{{ self.inject('key') }}`` 在调用时以调用方 Agent "
"为上下文求值， 沿 provide-inject 链向根查找；链上找不到提供者抛 ``MissingProvideError``。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter precedence: specified values (``specified``, including injection expressions) highest, then LLM-passed arguments, and finally schema defaults. Specified values are invisible to the LLM "
"and cannot be overridden by it — fixed values or parameters injected from the host context (``user_id`` / ``trace_id`` etc.) are declared as "
"specified values; this is a tamper-proof security boundary. An injection expression ``{{ self.inject('key') }}`` is evaluated at call time with the calling Agent "
"as context, searching up the provide-inject chain toward the root; if no provider is found on the chain, ``MissingProvideError`` is raised."

#: flowing.tool:79 of
msgid ""
"工具业务错误是正常产物：``execute`` 抛普通异常 → ``ToolResult(status=\"error\")``，LLM "
"可见、不触发任何错误钩子；``execute`` 内 ``raise Intercepted`` → "
"``ToolResult.blocked``。参数 / 返回值中的 编程错误（参数缺类型标注、返回值含违禁块、返回不可转换对象等） "
"走框架错误通道直接上抛（``ValueError`` / ``FormatError`` 等），不包 成 LLM 可见结果。"
msgstr ""
"Tool business errors are normal products: ``execute`` raising an ordinary exception → ``ToolResult(status=\"error\")``, visible to the LLM "
"and triggering no error hook; ``raise Intercepted`` inside ``execute`` → "
"``ToolResult.blocked``. Programming errors in parameters / return values (missing type annotations on parameters, forbidden blocks in return values, non-convertible objects returned, etc.) "
"go through the framework error channel and propagate directly (``ValueError`` / ``FormatError`` etc.) — they are not wrapped into an LLM-visible result."

#: flowing.tool:86 of
msgid ""
"审批等策略在 ``before_tool_call`` handler 内实现：``requires_approval`` 之类的字段只是 "
"``.fya`` 的非保留字段，原样成为工具对象的普通属性， 框架不解析、不据此做任何自动行为。handler 内 ``await`` "
"审批——通过 返回原值、改参数返回改写后的 `ToolCall`、拒绝 ``raise Intercepted``。"
msgstr ""
"Policies such as approval are implemented inside the ``before_tool_call`` handler: fields like ``requires_approval`` are merely "
"non-reserved ``.fya`` fields that become ordinary attributes of the tool object as-is; the framework neither parses them nor performs any automatic behavior based on them. The handler ``await``s the "
"approval — approve by returning the original value, modify parameters by returning a rewritten `ToolCall`, or reject with ``raise Intercepted``."

#: flowing.tool:91 of
msgid ""
"路径约定：工具定义文件（``.fya`` / ``.py``）的定位、``@/`` 项目根 锚定与命名空间派生规则见 "
":meth:`ToolRegistry.get`；``@/`` 上下文按 asyncio Task 隔离（见 "
":mod:`flowing.runtime`）。"
msgstr ""
"Path conventions: locating tool definition files (``.fya`` / ``.py``), anchoring ``@/`` to the project root, and namespace derivation rules — see "
":meth:`ToolRegistry.get`; the ``@/`` context is isolated per asyncio Task (see "
":mod:`flowing.runtime`)."

#: flowing.tool:121 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.agent` —— ``Agent.tool_call`` 的完整工具调用时序。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.agent` — the complete tool invocation sequence of ``Agent.tool_call``."

#: flowing.tool:122 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.hooks` —— ``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call`` 钩子语义。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.hooks` — the semantics of the ``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call`` hooks."

#: flowing.tool:124 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.builtins` —— 出厂内置工具。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.builtins` — factory builtin tools."

#: flowing.tool:125 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.params` —— 参数声明与 schema 桥接。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.params` — parameter declarations and schema bridging."

#: flowing.tool:126 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.message` —— 工具调用与结果的落树形态。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.message` — the tree-attached form of tool calls and results."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:1 of
msgid "MCP 工具实例——连接 MCP 服务器并代理其暴露的工具 schema。"
msgstr "MCP tool instance — connects to an MCP server and proxies the tool schema it exposes."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:5 of
msgid ""
"``type: mcp`` 的实例类。两种来源互斥：``command`` （本地 stdio 进程） 或 ``url`` "
"（远程端点，``/sse`` 结尾走 SSE、其余走 streamable HTTP）。 默认 `ToolDefinition` 来自 MCP "
"服务器 ``list_tools()`` 返回的 schema， 可经 ``overrides`` 局部覆写。MCP "
"工具无用户代码，是纯参数化配置—— 每个声明独立实例（区别于 script 单例）。"
msgstr ""
"The instance class of ``type: mcp``. The two sources are mutually exclusive: ``command`` (a local stdio process) or ``url`` "
"(a remote endpoint — those ending in ``/sse`` go over SSE, the rest over streamable HTTP). The default `ToolDefinition` comes from the schema returned by the MCP "
"server's ``list_tools()`` and can be partially overridden via ``overrides``. MCP "
"tools contain no user code; they are purely parameterized configuration — one independent instance per declaration (unlike the script singleton)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:11 of
msgid ""
"命名规则：MCP 声明块代理的是一组服务端工具，注册 / 解析时每个实际 工具的规范名 = ``<fya 声明名>-<server "
"暴露工具名>`` （如声明 ``name: github``、服务端暴露 ``create-issue`` → 注册规范名 ``github-"
"create-issue``）——服务端工具名空间天然带声明名前缀，不同 MCP 来源的同名工具不撞名。Agent 侧引用（``tools:`` "
"条目 / ``add_tool``）按合成名引用（可照常 ``as`` 别名）。"
msgstr ""
"Naming rule: an MCP declaration block proxies a group of server-side tools; at registration / resolution time, each actual tool's canonical name = ``<fya declaration name>-<server-"
"exposed tool name>`` (e.g. declaring ``name: github`` with the server exposing ``create-issue`` → registered canonical name ``github-"
"create-issue``) — the server-side tool namespace naturally carries the declaration-name prefix, so same-named tools from different MCP sources never collide. Agent-side references (``tools:`` "
"entries / ``add_tool``) refer to them by the composite name (``as`` aliases work as usual)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:43 of
msgid ""
"模板中的 ``env`` 是渲染上下文顶层对象（绑定 ``os.environ``），凭证经 ``{{ env.X }}`` "
"注入，不硬编码、不进消息、不落盘；缺失变量在装配期 fail fast（``FormatError``）。"
msgstr ""
"In templates, ``env`` is the top-level object of the rendering context (bound to ``os.environ``); credentials are injected via ``{{ env.X }}`` "
"— never hard-coded, never entering messages, never persisted; a missing variable fails fast at assembly time (``FormatError``)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:49 of
msgid ""
"来源识别：存在 ``command`` → stdio；存在 ``url`` → 远程；两者都有 → "
"`AmbiguousMcpSourceError`；两者都无 → `MissingMcpSourceError`。"
msgstr ""
"Source identification: ``command`` present → stdio; ``url`` present → remote; both present → "
"`AmbiguousMcpSourceError`; neither present → `MissingMcpSourceError`."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:51 of
msgid ""
"同名冲突：同命名空间规范名重名注册永远抛 `ToolNameConflictError` ——注册名为合成名 ``<声明名>-<server "
"暴露名>``，撞名即声明名重复， 须换声明名（或注册到不同命名空间）。"
msgstr ""
"Name conflicts: registering a duplicate canonical name in the same namespace always raises `ToolNameConflictError` — the registration name is the composite ``<declaration name>-<server-"
"exposed name>``, so a collision means the declaration name is duplicated and must be changed (or registered into a different namespace)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:54 of
msgid ""
"MCP 服务器的 ``outputSchema`` 自动填入 `ToolDefinition.output_schema` "
"（随声明携带，adapter 白名单不映射；当前实现不据此做结果校验，也 不喂模型）。"
msgstr ""
"The MCP server's ``outputSchema`` is automatically filled into `ToolDefinition.output_schema` "
"(carried along with the declaration; the adapter whitelist does not map it; the current implementation neither validates results against it nor feeds it to the model)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:57 of
msgid "连接失败 / 服务端 ``isError`` → ``status=\"error\"`` 结果；无连接重试 策略。"
msgstr "Connection failure / server-side ``isError`` → a ``status=\"error\"`` result; no connection retry policy."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool:62 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolRegistry` —— 重名约束的执行者。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolRegistry` — the enforcer of the duplicate-name constraint."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.list_tools:1 of
msgid "连接服务器拉取 ``list_tools()`` schema，产出逐工具代理实例列表。"
msgstr "Connects to the server, pulls the ``list_tools()`` schema, and produces a list of per-tool proxy instances."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.list_tools:5 of
msgid ""
"装配期 schema 拉取的唯一入口：``ToolRegistry.get`` 命中 mcp 型 TOOL.fya 只产声明实例（骨架 "
"definition）；装配层在 get 解析完成 后调用本方法一次——每个服务端工具产一个独立 `McpTool` 代理实例， 规范名 = "
"``<fya 声明名>-<server 暴露工具名>``，由装配层经 ``ToolRegistry.register`` 按合成名注册（撞名 → "
"``ToolNameConflictError``，注册表层承载）。``execute`` 不依赖本 方法（惰性连接），但 LLM "
"可见声明必须由本方法的产物承载。"
msgstr ""
"The sole entry point for assembly-time schema pulling: when ``ToolRegistry.get`` hits an mcp-type TOOL.fya it only produces the declaration instance (a skeleton "
"definition); the assembly layer calls this method once after get resolution completes — each server-side tool yields one independent `McpTool` proxy instance, with canonical name = "
"``<fya declaration name>-<server-exposed tool name>``, registered by the assembly layer under the composite name via ``ToolRegistry.register`` (collision → "
"``ToolNameConflictError``, handled at the registry layer). ``execute`` does not depend on this method (lazy connection), but the LLM-"
"visible declaration must be carried by this method's product."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.list_tools:15 of
msgid "``tools`` 子集过滤：声明了 ``tools`` 时仅展开子集内的服务端 工具；``None`` 全量展开。"
msgstr "``tools`` subset filtering: when ``tools`` is declared, only the server-side tools in the subset are expanded; ``None`` expands all of them."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.list_tools:17 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``overrides`` 应用：``{工具名: {description/args: ...}}``—— ``description`` "
"整体替换；``args`` 经 :func:`flowing.params.apply_param_overrides` 对 "
"inputSchema 派生的 properties 稀疏覆写（非法关键字 fail-fast）。"
msgstr ""
"``overrides`` application: ``{tool_name: {description/args: ...}}`` — ``description`` "
"is replaced wholesale; ``args`` is sparsely overridden via :func:`flowing.params.apply_param_overrides` against the "
"properties derived from inputSchema (illegal keywords fail fast)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.list_tools:21 of
msgid ""
"服务端 ``outputSchema`` 自动填入 "
":attr:`ToolDefinition.output_schema`——存储、随声明携带；当前 实现不据此做结果校验，也不喂模型。"
msgstr ""
"The server-side ``outputSchema`` is automatically filled into "
":attr:`ToolDefinition.output_schema` — stored and carried with the declaration; the current implementation neither validates results against it nor feeds it to the model."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.list_tools:24 of
msgid ""
"MCP ``inputSchema`` → 框架 properties 映射的 required 口径对齐 ：框架以 ``default`` "
"有无派生 requiredness，服务端 schema 的 ``required`` 列表之外的 property 若无 ``default``"
" 补 ``default=None``——否则可选参数会被 ``schema_to_model`` 建成 必填字段。"
msgstr ""
"Aligning the required semantics of the MCP ``inputSchema`` → framework properties mapping: the framework derives requiredness from whether a ``default`` "
"exists; a property outside the server schema's ``required`` list that has no ``default`` "
"gets ``default=None`` filled in — otherwise optional parameters would be built into required fields by ``schema_to_model``."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.execute:1 of
msgid "代理调用服务端工具：惰性连接 → ``call_tool`` → 取回产物。"
msgstr "Proxies the call to the server-side tool: lazy connection → ``call_tool`` → fetch the product."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.execute:5 of
msgid ""
"本方法只存在于 ``list_tools()`` 展开产物（``_server_tool_name`` 已置位）上；声明实例（组代理）直接执行 →"
" ``RuntimeError`` （按合成名 ``<声明名>-<server 名>`` 引用，属声明笔误）。"
msgstr ""
"This method only exists on the expansion products of ``list_tools()`` (those with ``_server_tool_name`` set); executing the declaration instance (the group proxy) directly → "
"``RuntimeError`` (referencing it by the composite name ``<declaration name>-<server name>`` counts as a declaration typo)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.execute:8 of
msgid ""
"连接失败 / 服务端 ``isError`` 返回 → 抛异常，由 ``__call__`` 包装为 ``status=\"error\"`` "
"结果（无连接重试）。"
msgstr ""
"Connection failure / server-side ``isError`` return → raises an exception, which ``__call__`` wraps into a ``status=\"error\"`` "
"result (no connection retry)."

#: flowing.tool.McpTool.execute:10 of
msgid ""
"返回形态：服务端 ``structuredContent`` 优先；否则文本块拼合 （单块 → str，多块 → list[str]，无 → "
"``None``）。"
msgstr ""
"Return form: server-side ``structuredContent`` takes precedence; otherwise text blocks are concatenated (single block → str, multiple blocks → list[str], none → "
"``None``)."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool:1 of
msgid "CLI 工具实例——Jinja2 命令模板 + shell 执行。"
msgstr "CLI tool instance — Jinja2 command template + shell execution."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool:5 of
msgid ""
"``type: cli`` 的实例类。``args`` （参数 schema）必填，无自动推断来源； 命令体 ``command`` 为 "
"Jinja2 模板，渲染上下文为 LLM 传入的 args。 把“跑个命令”类能力零代码化；安全默认值：框架自动转义模板插入值， 原始拼接必须显式"
" ``{{ arg | raw }}`` 且框架输出警告。"
msgstr ""
"The instance class of ``type: cli``. ``args`` (the parameter schema) is required, with no automatic inference source; the command body ``command`` is a "
"Jinja2 template whose rendering context is the args passed by the LLM. It turns 'run a command' capabilities into zero-code declarations; safe default: the framework automatically escapes template-inserted values, and raw concatenation requires explicit "
"``{{ arg | raw }}`` plus a framework warning."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool:41 of
msgid ""
"``shell`` 可选值：``sh`` （默认）/ ``bash`` / ``ps`` / ``powershell`` / "
"``cmd``；非法值在构造期抛 :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` （声明期尽早报错，不留到执行期）。"
msgstr ""
"Allowed ``shell`` values: ``sh`` (default) / ``bash`` / ``ps`` / ``powershell`` / "
"``cmd``; illegal values raise :class:`flowing.errors.FormatError` at construction time (report errors as early as declaration time, not left to execution time)."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool:44 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"返回值恒为 ``{exit_code, stdout, stderr}`` 三字段字典（``output:`` 声明进入 "
"`ToolDefinition.output_schema`，但不做字段提取）。"
msgstr ""
"The return value is always a three-field dict ``{exit_code, stdout, stderr}`` (the ``output:`` declaration goes into "
"`ToolDefinition.output_schema`, but no field extraction is performed)."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool:46 of
msgid ""
"非零退出码不等于 ``status=\"error\"``——exit_code 是正常输出数据； 仅进程无法启动等框架级失败才产生 "
"``error``。"
msgstr ""
"A non-zero exit code does not mean ``status=\"error\"`` — exit_code is normal output data; only framework-level failures such as being unable to start the process produce "
"``error``."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool:49 of
msgid "未声明 ``args`` 时（解析 ``.fya`` 阶段）。"
msgstr "When ``args`` is not declared (during the ``.fya`` parsing phase)."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool:54 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.RequestTool` —— 另一类零代码工具。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.RequestTool` — the other kind of zero-code tool."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool.execute:1 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "渲染命令模板 → shell 执行 → ``{exit_code, stdout, stderr}``。"
msgstr "Renders the command template → shell execution → ``{exit_code, stdout, stderr}``."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool.execute:5 of
msgid ""
"插入值自动经 ``shlex.quote`` 转义（finalize 单点）；显式 ``{{ arg | raw }}`` "
"旁路并输出告警日志（每次渲染命中）。"
msgstr ""
"Inserted values are automatically escaped via ``shlex.quote`` (single point in finalize); explicit ``{{ arg | raw }}`` "
"bypasses this and emits a warning log (on every rendering hit)."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool.execute:7 of
msgid ""
"非零退出码不是 error——exit_code 是正常输出数据；仅子进程无法 启动等框架级失败抛异常（由 ``__call__`` 包装为 "
"``status=\"error\"`` 结果）。"
msgstr ""
"A non-zero exit code is not an error — exit_code is normal output data; only framework-level failures such as being unable to start the subprocess raise an exception (wrapped by ``__call__`` into a "
"``status=\"error\"`` result)."

#: flowing.tool.CliTool.execute:10 of
msgid "stdout / stderr 按 UTF-8 解码（``errors=\"replace\"`` 容错）。"
msgstr "stdout / stderr are decoded as UTF-8 (tolerant via ``errors=\"replace\"``)."

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:1 of
msgid "HTTP/HTTPS 请求工具实例——按 ``args`` 构造请求，零代码。"
msgstr "HTTP/HTTPS request tool instance — builds the request from ``args``, zero code."

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:5 of
msgid ""
"``type: request`` 的实例类。``url`` 与 ``args`` 必填；参数到请求的 映射自动完成，可用 ``body`` / "
"``query`` 显式覆盖。与 `CliTool` 同理： 把“调一个 HTTP API”降为纯声明；凭证只经 ``{{ env.X }}`` "
"模板进入 请求头，不进消息、不落盘。"
msgstr ""
"The instance class of ``type: request``. ``url`` and ``args`` are required; the parameter-to-request mapping is done automatically and can be explicitly overridden with ``body`` / "
"``query``. Same idea as `CliTool`: it reduces 'call an HTTP API' to a pure declaration; credentials enter request headers only via the ``{{ env.X }}`` "
"template — never entering messages, never persisted."

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:46 of
msgid "URL 模板中出现的 ``{{ arg_name }}`` 识别为路径参数，自动从 body / query 排除；"
msgstr "A ``{{ arg_name }}`` appearing in the URL template is recognized as a path parameter and automatically excluded from body / query;"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:48 of
msgid ""
"非路径参数按 ``method`` 决定去向：``POST`` / ``PUT`` / ``PATCH`` → JSON body；``GET``"
" / ``DELETE`` → query string；``body`` / ``query`` 声明可显式覆盖；"
msgstr ""
"Non-path parameters go where ``method`` decides: ``POST`` / ``PUT`` / ``PATCH`` → JSON body; ``GET``"
" / ``DELETE`` → query string; the ``body`` / ``query`` declarations can explicitly override this;"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:51 of
msgid "``auth`` 与 ``headers`` 同时声明时，``auth`` 生成的头优先；"
msgstr "When ``auth`` and ``headers`` are both declared, the headers generated by ``auth`` take precedence;"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:52 of
msgid "响应默认按 JSON 解析作为返回值；声明 ``output`` 时按 schema 提取 字段，无关字段忽略（非 JSON 响应回退为文本）；"
msgstr "The response is parsed as JSON by default and used as the return value; when ``output`` is declared, fields are extracted per the schema and unrelated fields are ignored (non-JSON responses fall back to text);"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:54 of
msgid "响应状态码不在 ``expected_status`` 内 → ``status=\"error\"`` 结果 （含状态码与响应摘要），不抛异常。"
msgstr "A response status code outside ``expected_status`` → a ``status=\"error\"`` result (including the status code and a response summary), without raising an exception."

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:57 of
msgid "未声明 ``args`` 时。"
msgstr "When ``args`` is not declared."

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool:61 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.CliTool` —— 零代码工具的另一形态。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.CliTool` — the other form of zero-code tool."

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool.execute:1 of
msgid "按 args 构造 HTTP 请求并取回响应（args → 请求映射规则的执行体）。"
msgstr "Builds the HTTP request from args and fetches the response (the executor of the args → request mapping rules)."

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool.execute:5 of
msgid "URL 模板以 args 渲染（路径参数不转义——URL 结构由声明方负责）， 路径参数自动从 body / query 排除；"
msgstr "The URL template is rendered with args (path parameters are not escaped — URL structure is the declarer's responsibility); path parameters are automatically excluded from body / query;"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool.execute:7 of
msgid ""
"其余参数去向：``query`` / ``body`` 声明显式覆盖优先；否则按 ``method``——``POST`` / ``PUT`` /"
" ``PATCH`` → JSON body， ``GET`` / ``DELETE`` → query string；"
msgstr ""
"Where the remaining parameters go: explicit ``query`` / ``body`` declarations take precedence; otherwise by ``method`` — ``POST`` / ``PUT`` /"
" ``PATCH`` → JSON body, ``GET`` / ``DELETE`` → query string;"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool.execute:10 of
msgid "``auth`` 展开的请求头与 ``headers`` 冲突时 auth 优先；"
msgstr "When the headers expanded from ``auth`` conflict with ``headers``, auth takes precedence;"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool.execute:11 of
msgid ""
"响应状态码不在 ``expected_status`` 内 → 抛异常（含状态码与响应 摘要），由 ``__call__`` 包装为 "
"``status=\"error\"`` 结果，不向 调用方抛；"
msgstr ""
"A response status code outside ``expected_status`` → raises an exception (including the status code and a response summary), which ``__call__`` wraps into a "
"``status=\"error\"`` result rather than propagating to the caller;"

#: flowing.tool.RequestTool.execute:14 of
msgid ""
"响应默认按 JSON 解析；声明了 ``output`` （``definition.output_schema``）时按 schema 的 "
"properties 提取字段，无关字段 忽略；非 JSON 响应回退为文本。"
msgstr ""
"The response is parsed as JSON by default; when ``output`` (``definition.output_schema``) is declared, fields are extracted per the schema's "
"properties and unrelated fields are ignored; non-JSON responses fall back to text."

#: of typing.Literal:1
msgid "工具执行结果的状态四值。"
msgstr "The four status values of a tool execution result."

#: of typing.Literal:3
msgid "``\"completed\"``：正常完成，返回值承载在 ``output`` 字段。"
msgstr "``\"completed\"``: finished normally; the return value is carried in the ``output`` field."

#: of typing.Literal:4
msgid ""
"``\"pending\"``：异步收据。三种形态产生：``execute`` 返回 ``asyncio.Task``；``execute`` 是"
" async generator（首个 ``yield`` 即收据内容）；``background = True`` 标记的普通 async "
"``execute``。 框架只回收据，真正结果稍后以独立消息到达（不阻塞逻辑 Turn）。"
msgstr ""
"``\"pending\"``: an asynchronous receipt. Produced in three forms: ``execute`` returning an ``asyncio.Task``; ``execute`` being an"
" async generator (the first ``yield`` is the receipt content); an ordinary async "
"``execute`` marked ``background = True``. The framework only collects the receipt; the real result arrives later as a standalone message (without blocking the logical Turn)."

#: of typing.Literal:8
msgid ""
"``\"blocked\"``：被钩子硬阻断的产物——``before_tool_call`` 拦截 （工具未执行）／ "
"``after_tool_call`` 拦截（工具已执行完、结果被丢弃） ／ ``execute`` 内 ``raise "
"Intercepted`` （执行被中断于中途）；只能经 ``ToolResult.blocked`` 工厂产生。"
msgstr ""
"``\"blocked\"``: the product of a hard block by a hook — intercepted by ``before_tool_call`` (tool not executed) / "
"intercepted by ``after_tool_call`` (tool already executed, result discarded) / ``raise "
"Intercepted`` inside ``execute`` (execution interrupted midway); can only be produced via the ``ToolResult.blocked`` factory."

#: of typing.Literal:12
msgid ""
"``\"error\"``：执行抛普通异常的正常产物——LLM 可见、不触发任何错误 钩子（核心错误钩子仅 "
"``on_provider_error``，见 :mod:`flowing.hooks`）。"
msgstr ""
"``\"error\"``: the normal product of ``execute`` raising an ordinary exception — visible to the LLM, triggering no error hook (the only core error hook is "
"``on_provider_error``; see :mod:`flowing.hooks`)."

#: of typing.Literal:1
msgid "四种工具类型判别值（``.fya`` 的 ``type:`` 字段取值）。"
msgstr "The four tool type discriminator values (values of the ``type:`` field in ``.fya``)."

#: of typing.Literal:3
msgid ""
"``\"script\"``：Python callable（`ScriptTool` 子类 / 裸函数 / ``callable:`` "
"指针指向），全局单例注册——所有 Agent 共享同一实例。"
msgstr ""
"``\"script\"``: a Python callable (pointed to by a `ScriptTool` subclass / a bare function / a ``callable:`` "
"pointer), registered as a global singleton — all Agents share the same instance."

#: of typing.Literal:5
msgid "``\"mcp\"``：MCP 服务器（本地 stdio 进程或远程端点），每个声明 独立实例。"
msgstr "``\"mcp\"``: an MCP server (local stdio process or remote endpoint), one independent instance per declaration."

#: of typing.Literal:7
msgid "``\"cli\"``：命令行工具（Jinja2 命令模板），每个声明独立实例。"
msgstr "``\"cli\"``: a command-line tool (Jinja2 command template), one independent instance per declaration."

#: of typing.Literal:8
msgid "``\"request\"``：HTTP/HTTPS 请求工具，每个声明独立实例。"
msgstr "``\"request\"``: an HTTP/HTTPS request tool, one independent instance per declaration."

#: of typing.Literal:10
msgid "script 是单例是因为其业务逻辑是用户代码，不应实例化多次；其余三类 只是参数化配置，没有用户代码。"
msgstr "script is a singleton because its business logic is user code and should not be instantiated multiple times; the other three types are just parameterized configuration with no user code."

#: flowing.tool.MediaConverter:1 of
msgid "第三方库对象 → 媒体载体的转换器注册条目（由 :func:`register_media_converter` 写入模块级注册表）。"
msgstr "Registry entry of a third-party library object → media carrier converter (written into the module-level registry by :func:`register_media_converter`)."

#: flowing.tool.MediaConverter:6 of
msgid ""
"条目固定为 ``(module, qualname, convert)`` 三元组：前两者是第三方 "
"库对象的类全名（``模块名.类限定名``），``convert`` 是把该对象转为 `Image` / `File` / `Audio` / "
"`Video` 四类载体之一的函数。匹配时沿 对象的类 MRO 逐级比对全名——子类实例同样命中（注册的是基类、返回 "
"的是子类实例也能转换）。注册表天然惰性：库在任何时候被 import， 下一次判别即生效，没有初始化快照问题。"
msgstr ""
"An entry is fixed as the ``(module, qualname, convert)`` triple: the first two are the fully qualified class name of the third-party "
"library object (``module_name.class_qualname``), and ``convert`` is the function that turns the object into one of the four carriers `Image` / `File` / `Audio` / "
"`Video`. Matching compares the full name level by level along the object's class MRO — subclass instances match too (if a base class was registered, a returned subclass instance can still be converted). "
"The registry is naturally lazy: whenever the library is imported, the next discrimination takes effect — there is no initialization snapshot problem."

#: flowing.tool.MediaConverter:15 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.tool.register_media_converter` —— 注册入口。"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.tool.register_media_converter` — the registration entry point."

#: flowing.tool.MediaConverter:16 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.tool.normalize_output` —— 匹配与转换的消费点。"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.tool.normalize_output` — the consumption point of matching and conversion."

#: flowing.tool.MediaConverter.module:1 of
msgid "库模块全名，如 ``\"PIL.Image\"``。"
msgstr "Fully qualified library module name, e.g. ``\"PIL.Image\"``."

#: flowing.tool.MediaConverter.qualname:1 of
msgid "类限定名，如 ``\"Image\"``。"
msgstr "Class qualname, e.g. ``\"Image\"``."

#: flowing.tool.MediaConverter.convert:1 of
msgid "第三方对象 → 执行层载体四类之一的转换函数。"
msgstr "Conversion function from a third-party object to one of the four execution-layer carriers."
